# Firebase Admin SDK service account keys (Firebase's default download name) —
# a real secret (Firebase Admin access), unlike google-services.json which
# is a client config file and stays tracked so EAS Build's git-aware archive
# step actually includes it.
*firebase-adminsdk*.json

